INSERT INTO `category_translations` VALUES (1,1,'Root','root','','Root Category Description','','','',NULL,NULL,NULL,'en'),(2,2,'Bag Charms','bag-charms','','<p>Add a little extra cuteness to every bag with our adorable collection of <strong>kawaii bag charms</strong>. From soft plush characters and pastel keychains to playful accessories made for handbags, backpacks, totes and school bags, Kawaii Blessings brings you charming little companions that make every look more fun. Explore cute, collectible and gift-worthy bag charms sourced with authenticity in mind and delivered across the UAE. 🌸💖</p>','Kawaii Bag Charms UAE | Cute Plush Charms & Keychains | Kawaii Blessings','Shop cute kawaii bag charms, plush keychains and character accessories at Kawaii Blessings UAE. Perfect for handbags, backpacks, gifts and everyday kawaii style.','kawaii bag charms UAE, cute bag charms Dubai, plush bag charms, kawaii keychains UAE, cute keychains Dubai, character bag charms, backpack charms, handbag charms, kawaii accessories UAE, cute accessories Dubai, plush keychains, Japanese kawaii accessories, gift bag charms UAE, Kawaii Blessings','','',1,'en'),(3,3,'Kawaii Parisu Merch','kawaii-parisu-merch','','<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">Step into the dreamy world of <strong>Kawaii Parisu Merch</strong> at Kawaii Blessings, where pastel charm, adorable details and irresistibly cute accessories come together in one magical collection. 🎀✨</p>\n<p>Explore a curated selection of kawaii-inspired bags, accessories, collectibles, character-themed items and gift-worthy finds designed for anyone who loves soft colours, playful styles and everyday cuteness.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re looking for something sweet for yourself or a charming present for someone special, the <strong>Kawaii Parisu Merch</strong> collection is full of delightful pieces made to add a little extra joy to your day. 💖</p>\n<p>Perfect for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Kawaii lovers and collectors</li>\n<li>Cute bag and accessory fans</li>\n<li>Pastel aesthetic enthusiasts</li>\n<li>Birthday and surprise gifts</li>\n<li>Everyday adorable styling</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Discover your next favourite kawaii treasure and make every day a little more magical. ✧˖°♡</p>','Kawaii Parisu Merch','Kawaii Parisu Merch','Kawaii Parisu Merch','','',1,'en'),(4,4,'Blind Box','blind-box','','<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">Unbox a little mystery and a lot of cuteness with our <strong>Blind Box</strong> collection at Kawaii Blessings. 🎁✨ Each box hides a surprise character or collectible, making every unboxing feel extra exciting.</p>\n<p>From adorable mini figures and character collectibles to limited-edition designs and display-worthy surprises, blind boxes are perfect for collectors, gifting, desk décor, shelf displays, and anyone who loves the thrill of not knowing which cute character is inside.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re starting a new collection or hunting for your next favourite surprise, our Blind Box range is packed with kawaii fun, collectible charm, and happy little moments. 💖</p>','Blind Box UAE | Cute Collectibles & Mystery Figures | Kawaii Blessings','Shop cute blind boxes, mystery figures and collectible surprises at Kawaii Blessings UAE. Perfect for collectors, gifts, desk décor and kawaii fans.','blind box UAE, kawaii blind box, mystery box collectibles, cute blind boxes Dubai, collectible figures UAE, mystery figures UAE, kawaii collectibles, character blind box, mini figures UAE, surprise box gifts, cute collectibles Dubai, anime blind box UAE, gift ideas UAE, Kawaii Blessings','','',1,'en'),(5,5,'Plushies','plushies','','<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">Snuggle into pure cuteness with our <strong>Plushies</strong> collection at Kawaii Blessings. 🧸💖 From soft and cuddly character plushies to adorable collectible companions, every piece is made to bring a little extra comfort, joy, and kawaii magic into your day.</p>\n<p>Perfect for bedrooms, desks, gifting, collecting, or simply keeping close for cozy moments, our plushies are full of personality and charm. Whether you love pastel animals, iconic characters, tiny mascots, or oversized cuddle buddies, there’s always a new soft friend waiting to be discovered.</p>\n<p>Find the perfect plushie to hug, display, gift, or add to your growing kawaii collection. ✨🌸</p>','Kawaii Plushies UAE | Cute Character Plush Toys | Kawaii Blessings','Shop cute kawaii plushies, character soft toys and collectible stuffed animals at Kawaii Blessings UAE. Perfect for cuddles, gifts, décor and collectors.','kawaii plushies UAE, cute plush toys Dubai, character plushies UAE, soft toys UAE, kawaii stuffed animals, collectible plush toys, cute plushies Dubai, anime plushies UAE, character soft toys, pastel plushies, kawaii gifts UAE, plush toys for gifts, cute stuffed animals Dubai, Kawaii Blessings plushies','','',1,'en'),(6,6,'Popmart Collection','popmart-collection','','<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">Discover the playful world of <strong>Popmart Collection</strong> at Kawaii Blessings, filled with adorable designer figures, collectible characters, surprise-box favourites, and display-worthy kawaii treasures. 🎀✨</p>\n<p>Perfect for collectors, gift lovers, and anyone who enjoys cute character art, this collection brings together charming pieces made to brighten shelves, desks, display corners, and everyday spaces.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re building your collection, hunting for a favourite character, or looking for a fun gift, our <strong>Popmart Collection</strong> is full of cute finds, collectible charm, and exciting little surprises. 💖</p>','Popmart Collection UAE | Cute Collectibles & Figures | Kawaii Blessings','Shop Popmart collectibles, cute figures and designer character toys at Kawaii Blessings UAE. Perfect for collectors, gifts, displays and kawaii fans.','Popmart UAE, Popmart collection UAE, Popmart figures Dubai, cute collectible figures UAE, designer toys UAE, kawaii collectibles, blind box figures UAE, collectible characters Dubai, Popmart gifts UAE, cute figures Dubai, kawaii designer toys, collectible toys UAE, character figures UAE, Kawaii Blessings','','',1,'en'),(7,7,'Chiikawa collection','chiikawa-collection','','<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">Step into the adorable world of <strong>Chiikawa</strong> at Kawaii Blessings. 🌸✨ Discover cute character collectibles, accessories, plushies, gifts, and everyday kawaii finds featuring the lovable Chiikawa universe.</p>\n<p>Perfect for fans, collectors, and anyone who loves soft pastel characters and cheerful little companions, the <strong>Chiikawa Collection</strong> is full of charming pieces made for gifting, displaying, collecting, and adding extra cuteness to your day. 💖</p>\n<p>Whether you’re looking for a sweet desk companion, a collectible treasure, or a thoughtful gift for a Chiikawa fan, there’s always something adorable waiting to be discovered.</p>','Chiikawa Collection UAE | Cute Collectibles & Gifts | Kawaii Blessings','Shop Chiikawa plushies, collectibles, accessories and cute gifts at Kawaii Blessings UAE. Adorable finds for fans, collectors and kawaii lovers.','Chiikawa UAE, Chiikawa collection UAE, Chiikawa plushies, Chiikawa collectibles, Chiikawa gifts UAE, Chiikawa merchandise Dubai, kawaii character gifts, cute collectibles UAE, Chiikawa accessories, Chiikawa toys UAE, kawaii plushies Dubai, Japanese character merchandise UAE, Kawaii Blessings','','',1,'en'),(8,8,'Mofusand collection','mofusand-collection','','<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">Fall in love with the irresistibly cute world of <strong>Mofusand</strong> at Kawaii Blessings. 🐱💖 Discover adorable cat-themed collectibles, plushies, accessories, gifts, and everyday kawaii finds featuring the playful charm of Mofusand’s lovable feline characters.</p>\n<p>Perfect for cat lovers, collectors, and anyone who enjoys soft, funny, and heart-melting character designs, the <strong>Mofusand Collection</strong> is made for gifting, displaying, collecting, or simply adding a little extra happiness to your day. ✨</p>\n<p>Whether you’re looking for a cuddly companion, a cute desk accessory, or a charming gift for a fellow Mofusand fan, there’s always something paw-sitively adorable waiting for you.</p>','Mofusand Collection UAE | Cute Cat Collectibles & Gifts | Kawaii Blessings','Shop Mofusand plushies, cat collectibles, accessories and cute gifts at Kawaii Blessings UAE. Perfect for cat lovers, collectors and kawaii fans.','Mofusand UAE, Mofusand collection UAE, Mofusand plushies, Mofusand merchandise Dubai, Mofusand collectibles, Mofusand gifts UAE, cute cat collectibles, kawaii cat merchandise UAE, Mofusand accessories, cat plushies Dubai, Japanese character gifts UAE, kawaii collectibles UAE, Kawaii Blessings','','',1,'en');
